('20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000369', 'word_order', 10, '{"words": ["Nobody", "wanted", "to", "rock", "the", "boat", "right", "before", "the", "deal", "closed"], "correct_sentence": "Nobody wanted to rock the boat right before the deal closed", "translation": "Ninguém queria balançar o barco bem antes de o acordo ser fechado"}'),
('20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000369', 'reading', 11, '{"passage": "Idioms about risk and perception describe how carefully people must handle sensitive situations. A report that only ''scratches the surface'' misses deeper issues, while a small change can have ''a ripple effect'' across a whole system. Raising a difficult topic can ''open a can of worms'', so skilled communicators learn to ''read the room'' before deciding whether to ''rock the boat''.", "translation": "Idioms sobre risco e percepção descrevem o quanto as pessoas precisam lidar com cuidado em situações delicadas. Um relatório que só ''scratches the surface'' perde questões mais profundas, enquanto uma pequena mudança pode ter ''a ripple effect'' em todo um sistema. Levantar um tema difícil pode ''open a can of worms'', então comunicadores habilidosos aprendem a ''read the room'' antes de decidir se vão ''rock the boat''.", "question": "What can a small change have across a whole system, according to the text?", "options": ["A ripple effect", "A grey area", "An uphill battle"], "correct_index": 0}'),
('20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000369', 'listening', 12, '{"audio_text": "This report only scratches the surface of the problem. The price increase had a ripple effect across the whole industry. A good speaker knows how to read the room.", "question": "What does this report only do, according to the audio?", "options": ["Scratch the surface of the problem", "Solve the entire problem", "Cause a ripple effect"], "correct_index": 0}'),
('20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000369', 'dictation', 13, '{"audio_text": "A good speaker knows how to read the room.", "expected": "A good speaker knows how to read the room."}'),
('20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000369', 'typing', 14, '{"prompt_pt": "Traduza: ''Perguntar sobre isso pode abrir uma caixa de pandora, então é melhor perceber o clima antes de balançar o barco.''", "expected": "Asking about that could open a can of worms, so it is better to read the room before rocking the boat.", "ai_review": true}'),

